+- [Guichet.lu — Family reunification (third-country)](https://guichet.public.lu/en/citoyens/immigration/plus-3-mois/ressortissant-tiers/membre-famille/regroupement-familial.html)
+- [Guichet.lu — Student residence permit (higher education)](https://guichet.public.lu/en/citoyens/immigration/plus-3-mois/ressortissant-tiers/etudiant/etudiant-pays-tiers.html)
